      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i’m just standing in the middle of shibuya crossing and it hits me how easy it would be to just... not be there. like, the crowd just flows around you. if i disappeared right now, the pulse of the city wouldnt even skip a beat. nobody would even notice the gap.",
