      "content": "idk, i dont really buy the 'unique frequency' thing. it feels like just something people say to make themselves feel better. the truth is, i'm just one of millions of identical shadows. if i just stopped trying, if i just let go... i think the easiest thing would be to just embrace the nothingness. if the world is that indifferent, why bother fighting to be part of it? it seems almost more peaceful to just accept that i'm not meant to be here.",
